meta {
  name: Clear store (destructive)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{fhirBase}}/$clear-store
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  ⚠️ DESTRUCTIVE — `$clear-store` wipes the entire FHIR store. Dev/test only.

  Scope-gated: requires `maintenance/database.destructive`, and is additionally
  guarded by the `AllowClearStore` feature flag (returns `404 Unknown operation`
  when off). The default token carries no scopes (403 until scoped). Grant the
  scope on the dev client, add it to the **Get token** body and re-run, and enable
  the flag in `appsettings.local.json`. See the README "Scopes" section.
}
